<milestone@[ n="@(param)"]@/>
>-@

@@/ A core milestone is TEI's milestone: the scheme its unit, the
@@/ value its n, as the importer reads them.
@-> *milestone
<milestone unit="@(scheme)" n="@(value)"/>
>-@

